{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>For now I had sent forth My hand, etc.</b> For had I wished — when My hand was upon your livestock that I struck with pestilence — I would have sent it forth and struck <b>you and your people</b> along with the animals, <b>and you would have been cut off from the earth</b>; but <b>for this cause I have made you stand, etc.</b>"], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:11.597423840Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}